From now on, you can take SendPulse-based online courses in our mobile app!
Education by SendPulse is a mobile version of a student's account where they can edit their profile, take courses, track learning progress, and communicate with teachers.
The application helps to study on the go, on vacation, or before bedtime. Everything you need is already in your hands. A smartphone or tablet is enough to sign up for a course, set up a personal account, and complete training.

Work with courses before enrolling:
 • View the list of available courses and the overall progress; 
 • enroll in a course; 
 • study the program; 
 • start learning. 

Work with courses while taking them:
 • View lessons and mark the completed ones; 
 • take tests; 
 • do your home assignments; 
 • leave your questions and view teachers' answers.
